OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders  
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening 
OL,6,Fwill be dry with some frost and fog    
OL,7,Fpatches. Then it will stay dry for the 
OL,8,Frest of the night but clouding over    
OL,9,Flater. Breezy in the west by dawn.     
OL,11,CSaturday:FAfter a dry start it will    
OL,12,Fbecome cloudy with rain spreading      
OL,13,Fnorth in the afternoon, turning        
OL,14,Fheavier in the evening, East Lothian   
OL,15,Fholding dry until mid afternoon.       
OL,17,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FBright  
OL,18,Fspells and a few showers on Sunday.    
OL,19,FMild and windy with occasional rain on 
OL,20,FMonday, drier in the east. Mainly dry  
OL,21,Fand bright on Tuesday.                 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
